   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Two properties make all of this tractable:  objects are IMMUTABLE (no partial update, so no concurrent-writer problem and no\nre-replication for consistency), and the access pattern is WRITE ONCE, READ MANY (about 95% of operations are reads).",
   "originalText": "Two properties make all of this tractable:  objects are IMMUTABLE (no partial update, so no concurrent-writer problem and no\nre-replication for consistency), and the access pattern is WRITE ONCE, READ MANY (about 95% of operations are reads).",
